<DESCRIPTION>EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT DATED AS OF MARCH 31, 2021 BY AND BETWEEN BIT DIGITAL, INC. AND SAM TABAR, AS AMENDED AS OF JANUARY 1, 2022, AS OF MARCH 31, 2023, AND AS OF MARCH 1, 2025
