<HTML>
<HEAD>
     <TITLE></TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="text-align: right; margin: 0"><B>Exhibit 10.8</B></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>AMENDMENT NO. 3 TO<BR>
EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">AMENDMENT NO. 3 TO EMPLOYMENT
AGREEMENT (the &ldquo;Amendment&rdquo;) dated as of March 1, 2021, as previously amended as of January 1, 2022 and March 31, 2023 and
amended as of March 25, 2026 (the &ldquo;Effective Date&rdquo;) by and between Bit Digital, Inc., a Cayman Island exempted company, with
its principal business at 31 Hudson Yards, 11<SUP>th</SUP> Fl., New York, New York 10001 (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) and Sam Tabar, with
an address at 16 Rua do Monte Olivete, Lisbon Portugal 1200-280 (the &ldquo;Executive&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><U>W I T N E S S E T H :</U></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the Company
and the Executive entered into an Employment Agreement dated as of March 1, 2021 (the &ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the Company
and the Executive entered into an Amendment to Employment Agreement effective as of the January 1, 2022;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the Company
and the Executive entered into Amendment No 2 and Employment Agreement effective dated as of March 31, 2023;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the Executive
has played a substantial role in the growth of the Company; and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the Company
desires to further extend the term of the Agreement for an additional two (2) years as Chief Executive Officer upon the terms and conditions
set forth in the Amendment.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>NOW, THEREFORE</B>, in
consideration of the mutual premises and covenants and agreements contained herein and for other good and valuable consideration by each
of the parties, the parties hereby agree as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">1. <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Section
2. <U>Term of Agreement</U> is amended to read as follows: &ldquo;Subject to earlier termination pursuant to Section 8 below, the employment
relationship created hereunder shall continue from the Effective Date until March 31, 2027.&rdquo; The term of employment shall, for additional
one-year terms on the second anniversary date of the Effective Date, be deemed automatically renewed and extended upon the same terms
and conditions (the &ldquo;Renewal Term&rdquo;) unless either party, at least ninety (90) calendar days prior to the expiration of the
Initial Term, shall give written notice to the other of his or its intention not to renew such employment term (a &ldquo;Non-Renewal Notice&rdquo;).
The period during which Executive is employed under this Agreement (including any Renewal Term) will be referred to as the &ldquo;Employment
Period.&rdquo;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">2. <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Section
5. <U>Compensation for Services</U>. The first sentence of Section 5(a) Base Salary is hereby amended to read as follows:</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&ldquo;Executive shall receive
an annual salary of Five Hundred Thousand ($500,000) Dollars during the term of this Amendment, payable no less frequently than semi-monthly
in accordance with the Company&rsquo;s regular payroll practice (the &ldquo;Base Salary&rdquo;).&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0.25in 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">3. <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Section
5(c). Except as set forth herein, the Agreement, as previously amended, remains in full force and effect.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></P>

